# Open Play Deployment Checklist

## Scope

Use only when Sam explicitly asks to deploy Open Play.

## Agent must run (from `Website/` = repo root)

1. **Do not run `npm run local-test:sync` to copy files.** Local-page is independent.
2. **`npm test`** — must pass before deploy.
3. **`npm run deploy:openplay`** — push **`Programs/Pickleball/live`** to **Firebase Hosting** (`firebase.json` → `hosting.public`). This updates the **hosted URL** (e.g. `*.web.app` / custom domain for project `pickleball-advanced-open-play`).

If deploy fails (auth): run **`firebase login`** once locally, or configure CI secret **`FIREBASE_TOKEN`** from **`firebase login:ci`**.

## CI (optional auto-deploy on push)

Workflow **`.github/workflows/deploy-openplay-firebase-hosting.yml`** runs on **`workflow_dispatch`** always, and on push to **`main`/`master`** only when repo variable **`OPENPLAY_CI_AUTO_DEPLOY`** is **`true`**. Requires GitHub Actions secret **`FIREBASE_TOKEN`** (`firebase login:ci`). See **`Programs/Pickleball/advanced-open-play/firebase-hosting/README.md`** (section **CI: auto-deploy on push**).

## Not auto here

- **Database rules** — use **`npm run firebase:deploy-rules`** when **`database.rules.json`** changes (or **`npm run deploy:openplay:all`** for hosting + rules together).

## Do not deploy

`Programs/Pickleball/advanced-open-play/testing/local-page/` — local test source only; **Hosting serves `live/`** per `firebase.json`.
